{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Membership for steady living</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
  <meta name="description" content="A membership framework for sustainable habit work: outcomes, habits, and repeatable frameworks"> 
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="brand">
        <svg class="logo" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="22" fill="none" stroke="#244" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M12 28c6-8 12-12 24-10" stroke="#246" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        <div>
          <h1 class="business">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>
          <p class="tag">{{TAGLINE}}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav class="nav">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="about.html">Our Frame</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="programs.html">Pathways</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Membership</a>
        <a href="testimonials.html">Stories</a>
        <a href="book.html">Book</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Reach</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" style="background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg')">
      <div class="wrap hero-inner">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <h2 class="headline">A pragmatic scaffold for steadier days</h2>
          <p class="sub">Membership-shaped guidance that turns intent into compact, repeatable practices — outcomes first, then the habits that carry them.</p>
          <div class="hero-ctas">
            <a id="primaryCta" class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            <a class="btn ghost" href="programs.html">Explore Pathways</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <aside class="hero-tools">
          <div class="panel">
            <h3>Mood-to-Method</h3>
            <p class="small">Pick how you feel now — we’ll shape one concise approach and alter the joining prompt.</p>
            <div class="moods" role="tablist" aria-label="Mood options">
              <button class="mood" data-method="Breathwork & MicroRoutines" data-cta="Begin Breath & Micro 14-day">Stressed</button>
              <button class="mood" data-method="Focus Mapping & Gentle Structure" data-cta="Try Focus Map — 2 weeks">Foggy</button>
              <button class="mood" data-method="Energy Channels & Anchors" data-cta="Start Energy Anchors">Energetic</button>
              <button class="mood" data-method="Reset, Prioritize, Practice" data-cta="Start a Reset Sprint">Stuck</button>
            </div>
            <div id="methodRecommendation" class="recommendation">
              <strong>Recommended approach</strong>
              <p id="methodText">Select how you feel to see a focused method.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="panel">
            <h3>30-day Path Map</h3>
            <p class="small">Tick a few goals and watch a tailored month plan appear.</p>
            <form id="goalsForm">
              <label><input type="checkbox" name="goal" value="sleep"> Better sleep
              </label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" name="goal" value="calm"> More calm
              </label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" name="goal" value="focus"> Sharper focus
              </label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" name="goal" value="energy"> Steady energy
              </label>
            </form>
            <div id="pathMap" class="pathmap" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg id="daysSvg" viewBox="0 0 300 40" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet"></svg>
              <div id="dayPlan" class="dayplan"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pillars wrap">
      <h3>Core commitments of the membership</h3>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="pill">
          <h4>Outcome-first frameworks</h4>
          <p>We start with the result you care about and build the smallest practices that reliably lead there.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pill">
          <h4>Habit scaffolds</h4>
          <p>Micro-rituals that stack into bigger shifts, documented so you can keep what works.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pill">
          <h4>Weekly calibrations</h4>
          <p>Short checkpoints to adjust pacing, not overhaul your life.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="case-notes wrap">
      <h3>Case Notes</h3>
      <p class="small">Real-enough summaries of how members navigated the first month.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Layered Rest:</strong> 14-day breathing + micro-sleep routine reduced nightly wakeups and stabilized morning momentum.</li>
        <li><strong>Focus Blocks:</strong> Mapping attention windows led to 3 reliable flow blocks per week for creative work.</li>
        <li><strong>Energy Anchors:</strong> Short, repeated mid-day anchors prevented late-afternoon dips without stimulants.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="faq wrap">
      <h3>FAQ</h3>
      <details><summary>Is this therapy or medical care?</summary><p>This membership offers coaching tools, habit frameworks, and accountability. It is not medical or clinical treatment.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What kind of commitment does membership require?</summary><p>Members typically spend 10–20 minutes per day on guided practices and one weekly review. Sessions and materials scale based on your goals.</p></details>
    </section>

    <section class="cta wrap">
      <h3>Ready to try a membership approach?</h3>
      <a id="secondaryCta" class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      <p class="muted">Questions? Call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> or email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="wrap">
      <nav class="footnav">
        <a href="about.html">Our Frame</a>
        <a href="programs.html">Pathways</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Membership</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Reach</a>
      </nav>
      <p class="small">Serving residents of {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>"} 
